# nord-usb replay script: a full read-only inventory sweep.
# One transaction per object class: UI hello, SESSION_OPEN(class),
# STATUS(class), SESSION_CLOSE, UI goodbye.
# Generated from the protocol spec; counters are real Electro 5 values,
# read off the instrument on 2026-07-26.
# Format: '<O|I> <hex>' -- O = host->device, I = device->host.

